{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_020_synopsis", "source_sha256": "9e73962948aef4c7ef1d22e2bd5ec493161bf992d7aa98f15e53038e79784433", "ja": "立候補したものの、どんな公演にしようかと\n悩む美也。海美、朋花と向かった公園で、\n律子と貴音に会う。美也はみんなとの\n会話の中から、自分らしいステージの\nヒントを見つけ出す。", "zh": "美也虽然毛遂自荐，\n却苦恼该展现什么样的公演。\n此时她与海美、朋花一起前往公园，\n在那里遇见律子与贵音。与大家聊天时，\n美也发现了让舞台充满自我风格的提示。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_020_1000_042miy", "source_sha256": "64e1daeb33457acf6d7aa7de387063abca02fc5dbf1cad52bdbb27e0f6bb9141", "ja": "みなさ～ん、今日の公演はどうでしたか～？\n私は、とっても楽しかったですよ～♪", "zh": "大家～今天的公演怎么样呢～？\n我觉得非常开心喔～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_020_1001_042miy", "source_sha256": "0dfdbcf30abaa0d866eba686f11a6a61168ba49c6a872f1c7fd302cfeb63d662", "ja": "でも、765プロライブ劇場の魅力は\nまだまだこんなものじゃありません～。", "zh": "不过，765艺能演唱会剧场的魅力，\n可远远不只有这样～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_020_1002_042miy", "source_sha256": "ee4017f7731c85c66b5f5ad46319cf8e16102502d3328b1d5f40f23ffbe95424", "ja": "これからも、私達がみなさんの手を引っ張って、\nご案内しますから。一緒に観てくださいね～。", "zh": "以后我们也会牵着你们的手，带各位领略剧场魅力。\n还请大家一起观赏更多公演喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_020_1003_audience", "source_sha256": "60152b7583b201b4ba9b40269eaa5ce683ab0d2eb1cb96891ff19fcd8dc29708", "ja": "（わああぁぁぁーーー……！）", "zh": "（哇啊啊啊啊啊───！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_020_1004_p", "source_sha256": "4092212ffd07524c1ddd473ba8ce0932333a5539f4db5be99fb9863d36b4fcdb", "ja": "（大歓声の中、美也のセンター公演は、\n無事に幕を下ろした……）", "zh": "（在如雷贯耳的欢呼声中，\n美也的Center公演平安落幕……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_020_1005_042miy", "source_sha256": "e52496ae7df59cd6f1ea5963b740e6b815670c6ad0bb9b2bf8f98e06e2019e88", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お疲れさまです～。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，辛苦了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_020_1006_p", "source_sha256": "7167743370073217edf07cf7b4bea5f8f9b67bb845ab0730645cbf425201b852", "ja": "お疲れさま、美也！\nすごくいい公演だったぞ！", "zh": "辛苦你了，美也！\n这场公演非常棒喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_020_1007_042miy", "source_sha256": "99aea9a77a6b95f1e779b56c42949ab965e97738e24a55100fc77fca9c7714d5", "ja": "ふふふ～、そうでしたか～。\nということは、ちゃんと伝わったかもしれませんね～。", "zh": "呵呵呵～是这样吗～\n也就是说，我的想法说不定有顺利传达出去呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_020_1008_p", "source_sha256": "bec19d9140f718c4e1cb83252e8d6059ab840287a265bf0a53b0fe40ad7391ce", "ja": "そういえば……。\n美也は今日の公演で、何を伝えたかったんだ？", "zh": "这么说起来……\n美也你想在今天的公演里传达什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_020_1009_042miy", "source_sha256": "21d5413af78b4f49dc772cdf7db45b1c724c2745052a653c538f84188aec1165", "ja": "それはですね～。私、アイドルになってから、\n毎日がとっても楽しいんです～。", "zh": "这个嘛～\n就是我成为偶像后，每天都过得非常开心～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_020_1010_042miy", "source_sha256": "0a19aa8c9007cd462943b61fd81f3b46f439a4d0f7bfe1beff67884b105f0b2d", "ja": "公演でもお仕事でも、みんなと一緒に、\nたくさんの初めてを経験できますし～。", "zh": "不管是公演还是工作，\n我跟大家一起经历了许多全新的体验～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_020_1011_042miy", "source_sha256": "8d6e220c885a9366918520a0c68ca84092a9ca743eda01d4b07f25f112881ca5", "ja": "ですから、今日はお客さんに、\nそのことを伝えたいと思ったんです～。", "zh": "所以，我想在今天把这件事情传达给观众～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_020_1012_042miy", "source_sha256": "1328e3b6426a9a37abd936ffbe935ab1705a7908c83dc50dd29145af6f1a46ec", "ja": "私の立っているこの場所は～……\nこの劇場は、こんなに楽しいんですよ～って。", "zh": "告诉他们，我现在所站的这个地方……\n这间剧场是如此欢乐的地方喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_020_1013_042miy", "source_sha256": "8a2c01ca0d88ce1891a47d5a3dcfa25a97527bf8690b72b7bcd525463a100e0f", "ja": "{$P$}さん、\nちゃんと伝わりましたよね～？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，\n我有顺利传达给他们吧～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_020_1014_p", "source_sha256": "aa694e30f2eff86638f4e776d99c799a02e4fcbc776bbc9f877a466326b7849a", "ja": "もちろん。……ほら、帰り支度をしているお客さん達、\nみんな幸せそうに笑ってるだろ？", "zh": "当然有……你看，\n所有正在准备回去的观众都笑得很幸福对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_020_1015_p", "source_sha256": "90378753dced7ee25b3b7e2a1a8f48a9d0dc17388ec305e95377e15b911493cc", "ja": "しっかり伝わったと思うよ。\n散歩は大成功、ってところだな！", "zh": "我认为你有顺利传达出去了。\n可以说是「散步圆满成功」喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_020_1016_042miy", "source_sha256": "a16ece7416f8d7a802749616bae68a6679c2e83392024396e155a901fb4474ba", "ja": "おお～、本当ですね～。\nえへへ……とっても、嬉しいです～♪", "zh": "哦哦～真的呢～\n嘿嘿……我非常高兴～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_020_1017_p", "source_sha256": "ff2a5a75b3f6259e4482a02c7aa162540faeecc726d80b7b13af41e77e936395", "ja": "美也……。\nうん、本当にいいステージだった！", "zh": "美也……\n嗯，这真的是一场很棒的表演！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_020_1018_029umi", "source_sha256": "0fd80a33b2ba75ac85bec58abf08cb50d101ccaa14fc4268cbb9203452c69aaf", "ja": "美也ーっ、{$P$}！\nお疲れさまー！", "zh": "美也、{$P$}！\n辛苦了──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_020_1019_029umi", "source_sha256": "b8db6462a261cc04e73a5f75c737e947971692928c447a1b0c0352439679eeff", "ja": "なんだか、ずーっとにこにこして、ずーっとスキップ\nしたくなるステージだったね！　まだスキップしたい！", "zh": "这场表演让人一～直笑容满面、一～直想小跳步呢！\n我还想继续小跳步！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_020_1020_031tom", "source_sha256": "e5a75940bcd5317de4184b2c89d5e1c6c536249dd62d655506dbebff03b773aa", "ja": "あんなに穏やかで幸せそうな顔の子豚ちゃん達は、\n私も初めて見ましたよ～。", "zh": "我也是第一次，\n看见小猪们露出那么安稳又幸福的表情喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_020_1021_031tom", "source_sha256": "a25d55fe88e9b31bb55543edbbdaf1a1be4ccc8dd3fd1262eb903ba9d8c2acda", "ja": "聖母として、成長できた気がします～。\n本当に素晴らしい公演でした～♪", "zh": "我觉得自己作为圣母，好像有所成长了～\n这真的是一场非常棒的公演～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_020_1022_029umi", "source_sha256": "436549a71ec57cfc38f95b67351ea75a1d6f81a1ff2c837e0b22e913da2e45fe", "ja": "私がセンターのときも、とっても楽しかったけど、\n今日はね、なんか違ったの！　違う楽しいだったの！", "zh": "虽然之前我担任Center时也非常开心，\n但今天好像不太一样！是不一样的开心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_020_1023_029umi", "source_sha256": "01543623b1c1e9020bd96b571ee2aea58f5196f1d5137755bb41327f6a1940c5", "ja": "なんかね、ずーっと美也だった！\n美也の公演って、こういうことだったんだね！", "zh": "感觉整～场都是美也的风格！\n原来美也的公演是这个样子的呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_020_1024_042miy", "source_sha256": "df6c54ef702f6721a7951ddba6a98d1cb4ec86878e5db06c39d622613ae71eed", "ja": "ふふふ～、海美ちゃんも朋花ちゃんにも\nちゃんと伝えられて……よかったです～♪", "zh": "呵呵呵～我的想法也清楚地传达给\n海美和朋花了……真是太好了～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_020_1025_029umi", "source_sha256": "bf99586f3b4ca9fe2bf9cd1d0a49335b53744b484cdc4cf64561a8f6efc6a6f0", "ja": "ねえねえ、公演の大成功をお祝いして、\nみんなで何かしようよ！", "zh": "欸欸，大家一起做点什么，\n来庆祝公演圆满成功吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_020_1026_042miy", "source_sha256": "3bf23d93266a8533ab2a44f2588fb92a99e72966fdce0742cf23daddae64c798", "ja": "お～、いいですな～。そういえば、そろそろ\n公園のお花が咲いてるかもしれません～。", "zh": "哦～不错呢～\n对了，公园的花应该差不多该盛开了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_020_1027_031tom", "source_sha256": "aa39bd984340e8bbdf777576b6403828f3f17340cd42755b9593bcb06b4c7919", "ja": "律子さんや貴音さんも誘って、見に行きませんか～？　\nみんなでお弁当を持って、ピクニックです～♪", "zh": "要不要约律子姊和贵音一起去看看呢～？\n大家一起带便当去野餐吧～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_020_1028_029umi", "source_sha256": "c7239cd226232959277630567e1f28f4f31465eca5d9e428895066b9d11da855", "ja": "ピクニック、行きたーい！\nいつにするいつにする？", "zh": "我想去野餐──！\n什么时候要去？什么时候要去？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_020_1029_042miy", "source_sha256": "97b73b6d01c5a61238e1734c0d24d49fe51c6b5c5c94cd8e22e9a4302a98fba6", "ja": "{$P$}さんは、いつがお暇ですか～？", "zh": "{$P$}先生什么时候有空呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_020_1030_p", "source_sha256": "6980a252fc641f2176ffeb202c86281ccefbf306d13d73a77193535980451f43", "ja": "そうだな。え～っと、\n今はちょっと立て込んでるから……。", "zh": "我想想，呃～\n我现在工作有点多……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_020_1031_031tom", "source_sha256": "31d67b39f3fcdf93b661e898ee241e1ee07f8238b0ce52acc103ef3105d1bf1d", "ja": "もちろん、{$P$}さんも\n参加しますよね～？", "zh": "{$P$}先生当然也会参加吧～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_020_1032_p", "source_sha256": "3411232cafceb4e2a31787208e05e2d852ba03e718465830e8b89947eff7e03b", "ja": "も、もちろん。\nなんとかスケジュールを調節するよ。", "zh": "当、当然会，\n我会想办法调整行程的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_after_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_after_020_1033_p", "source_sha256": "ba699dafd1d4f26585f1cc38654db3bfb6fc573fbe70da804eee48cb090cc002", "ja": "……って、そろそろ撤収の時間か。ほらみんな、体が\n冷える前に着替えないと。ピクニックに行けないぞ！", "zh": "……啊，是时候撤场了。\n好了，大家得趁着凉前换衣服，否则就不能去野餐啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
